---
import AlexandrosZisimidis from "../../assets/testimonial/alexandros-zisimidis.jpg";
import GuillaumeMarquis from "../../assets/testimonial/guillaume-marquis.png";
import MaximeMouchet from "../../assets/testimonial/maxime-mouchet.jpg";
import LalitKundu from "../../assets/testimonial/lalit-kundu.jpg";
import DimitriKassubeck from "../../assets/testimonial/dimitri-kassubeck.jpg";
import SonyaRikhtverchik from "../../assets/testimonial/sonya-rikhtverchik.jpg";
import FabienDevos from "../../assets/testimonial/fabien-devos.jpg";
import EfimMirochnik from "../../assets/testimonial/efim-mirochnik.jpg";
import BaptisteArnaud from "../../assets/testimonial/baptiste-arnaud.jpg";
import GavinBains from "../../assets/testimonial/gavin-bains.jpg";
import ChristopherPrice from "../../assets/testimonial/christopher-price.jpg";
import JoshParolin from "../../assets/testimonial/josh-parolin.jpg";
import JeremieParker from "../../assets/testimonial/jeremie-parker.jpg";
import PierreDePoulpiquet from "../../assets/testimonial/pierre-de-poulpiquet.jpg";
import AdityavardhanAgrawal from "../../assets/testimonial/Adityavardhan-Agrawal.jpg";
import CamilleEpitalon from "../../assets/testimonial/Camille Epitalon.png";
import Scroll from "./TestimonialsScroll.svelte";
import Testimonial from "../ui/Testimonial.astro";
---

<section class="bg-linear-to-b from-[#F8FAF4] from-[0%] to-white to-[100%] py-10 sm:py-20">
  <h2 class="text-h3 sm:text-h2 mb-3 text-center font-medium">De ce aleg clienții ZebraByte</h2>
  <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-12 text-center text-lg">Recenzii reale de la clienți ZebraByte</p>

  <Scroll client:load>
    <Testimonial author="Cosmin Szavui" role="Google review">
      Am avut site-ul plin de viruși și tot timpul îmi dădea erori. Cei de la ZebraByte m-au ajutat imediat, au curățat tot, au securizat site-ul și l-au mutat pe serverele lor. De atunci merge perfect și nu am mai avut nicio problemă. Recomand 100%!
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial author="Alexandra Aless" role="Google review">
      Am început să colaborez cu Zebrabyte de câteva luni și au livrat mai mult decât m-am așteptat. Echipa este foarte profesionistă, răspunde rapid și explică pe înțelesul tuturor. Platformele de hosting sunt stabile, rapide și bine protejate.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial author="Stefania Iancu" role="Google review">
      Am avut o problemă urâtă cu site-ul, tot primeam alerte de securitate și linkuri ciudate apăreau peste tot. Cei de la ZebraByte au intrat imediat, au curățat tot și l-au mutat la ei. De atunci merge fără probleme, chiar și mai repede.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial author="Bănuță Cristina" role="Google review">Super profi! Am colaborat foarte bine cu această echipă. Toate cerințele au fost rezolvate într-un timp foarte scurt. Recomand!</Testimonial>
    <Testimonial author="Jadu Ro" role="Google review">Am lucrat extraordinar cu această echipă. Îi recomand!</Testimonial>
    <Testimonial author="Morosanu Gabriel" role="Trustpilot review">Very good team! Best cooperation I have ever seen. 10 stars!!!</Testimonial>
    <Testimonial author="Ijugin Gowtham" role="Trustpilot review">I couldn’t be happier with the web hosting services from ZebraByte UK. My website is running smoothly and reliably, and their support team is always quick to assist and genuinely helpful.</Testimonial>
    <Testimonial author="Laviclinic Jacob" role="Trustpilot review">It was really nice to design my website by Zebrabyte. The team was helpful and established everything from A to Z. I liked the suggestions they gave.</Testimonial>
    <Testimonial author="Florin Novac" role="Trustpilot review">A expert team and very friendly. I recommend 100% and thank you for your hard work.</Testimonial>
    <Testimonial author="Callum Jones" role="Trustpilot review">The website was easy to understand and use. The support given helped me out and was amazing and fast. I would recommend this app to anyone trying to host their own website.</Testimonial>
  </Scroll>

  <div class="container mt-16 sm:mt-24">
    <div class="mx-auto mb-10 max-w-3xl text-center">
      <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-3 text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em]">Upstream Probo</p>
      <h3 class="text-h3 mb-3 font-medium">Păstrăm și testimonialele originale Probo</h3>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground text-lg">Aceste testimoniale și fotografii aparțin experienței upstream Probo și sunt păstrate integral ca parte din proiect, fără a fi prezentate drept clienți ZebraByte.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <Scroll client:load>
    <Testimonial image={AdityavardhanAgrawal} author="Adityavardhan Agrawal" role="Co-founder at Morphik">The process was very straightforward, super fast, and best of all done for you with very clear and simple action items on our end.</Testimonial>
    <Testimonial image={CamilleEpitalon} author="Camille Epitalon" role="Co-founder & CTO at Verso">Compliance that works where we already do. In Slack, async, with almost no back-and-forth.</Testimonial>
    <Testimonial image={PierreDePoulpiquet} author="Pierre de Poulpiquet" role="Co-founder & CTO at Whaly">Working with Probo has been truly amazing so far; they are a true partner and very proactive, making our ISO certification seamless. We worked with Vanta in the past and didn't like the experience, but switching to Probo was night and day.</Testimonial>
    <Testimonial image={JeremieParker} author="Jérémie Parker" role="CTO at Trace For Good">Probo did all the heavy lifting and kept us focused on what really mattered. A tailored, no-nonsense approach to compliance that made the whole process refreshingly smooth.</Testimonial>
    <Testimonial image={JoshParolin} author="Josh Parolin" role="Co-founder & CTO at Sessionboard">Working with Probo was a game-changer for Sessionboard. After months of confusion, wasted time, and overpaying for various systems in our SOC 2 journey, partnering with Probo finally brought clarity and momentum.</Testimonial>
    <Testimonial image={ChristopherPrice} author="Christopher Price" role="Co-founder & COO at Sixtyfour">Probo was an excellent experience. The team was extremely professional, prompt and communicative. Having experienced Vanta, Drata, and now Probo, it makes it a no-brainer to recommend Probo for teams that need to get compliant quickly.</Testimonial>
    <Testimonial image={GavinBains} author="Gavin Bains" role="Co-founder at The LLM Data Company">Probo makes SOC 2 painless. They guided us step-by-step, kept us organized, and did all the heavy lifting to get us audit-ready. This team deeply cares about their customers and it shows.</Testimonial>
    <Testimonial image={BaptisteArnaud} author="Baptiste Arnaud" role="Founder at Typebot">Probo made getting ISO 27001 certified simple, fast, and human. Their open-source approach, direct Slack support, and ability to adapt to a one-person company made all the difference.</Testimonial>
    <Testimonial image={EfimMirochnik} author="Efim Mirochnik" role="CISO at Ahrefs">Probo has been a true partner. They adapted compliance and security to our daily jobs, took the heavy lifting and enabled us to move faster than expected.</Testimonial>
    <Testimonial image={FabienDevos} author="Fabien Devos" role="Co-founder & CTO at Vybe">Probo made the SOC2 process seamless, their support went way beyond what I expected. It's the first time I actually enjoyed compliance.</Testimonial>
    <Testimonial image={SonyaRikhtverchik} author="Sonya Rikhtverchik" role="COO at Vybe">Probo made the terrifying chore of SOC 2 compliance seem like a walk in Jardin des Tuileries.</Testimonial>
    <Testimonial image={DimitriKassubeck} author="Dimitri Kassubeck" role="Co-founder & CEO at Moby Analytics">Compliance, done right. Experts who focus on what truly matters. Hassle free - just one mission: make you more secure.</Testimonial>
    <Testimonial image={LalitKundu} author="Lalit Kundu" role="Co-founder & CEO at Delty">Probo team made SOC 2 compliance a smooth sail for us, working closely on explaining and implementing the controls, and even helped us go through vendor security for big enterprise contracts.</Testimonial>
    <Testimonial image={MaximeMouchet} author="Maxime Mouchet" role="Co-founder & CTO at Clarifeye">Our customers have high security expectations. We needed a partner who took compliance as seriously as we do. Probo was rigorous, responsive, and fast - exactly what we needed to get it done right.</Testimonial>
    <Testimonial image={GuillaumeMarquis} author="Guillaume Marquis" role="Co-founder & CEO at Basalt">Probo has been the ideal compliance partner. They built security and compliance around how we work, took on the heavy lifting and delivered fast.</Testimonial>
    <Testimonial image={AlexandrosZisimidis} author="Alexandros Zisimidis" role="Co-founder & COO at Cleon">Unlike typical compliance vendors that push every certification under the sun, Probo actually helps us think through which standards make sense for our business.</Testimonial>
  </Scroll>
</section>
